  <item>
    <title>于正白月光复活，谁还记得一开始许凯被锤啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b279d497178f08ee5eb24b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b279d497178f08ee5eb24b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于还是聊到了许凯这件事哈哈哈，大家闲着没事听听看吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群可以添加炮姐微信哦：jiaoban0714</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 先来聊聊何晟铭吧，杨幂二搭，古早年代女主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 回到事情起点，许荔莎自爆为许凯女友，于正许凯双双否认</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a> 插播一下我们对于赵晴的看法：于正开始捧了，但是演技还得改</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 退一万步，《子夜归》也是蹭上这波流量了，顺带表扬了一下张凌赫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> 怎么说着说着许凯，何晟铭成为古早白月光？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 于正为旗下艺人发声，赵嘉敏疑似被换角，女主还是我们小田（子夜归也是）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 这里，我们展开了一场莫名其妙的争论哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1534">25:34</a> 《五福临门》开机现场，于正疑似阴阳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 很癫的于正+很癫的滕泽文=？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1869">31:09</a> 网传于正曾被当街暴打</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> 于正仅半年可见的微博都发了点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a> 娱乐圈还有哪些不太一样的老板</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64a945ca73e3c34a6745c0bd/lm_8IfxO30L-NcM-wWkYt7V1H_HX.m4a" length="60943638" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-hCg3SzXKbZAc9kUC7t9mdeSK8.png"/>
