  <item>
    <title>陆地夫妇、耽改CP、农村调解节目，是时候拿出我们压箱底的宝藏了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a97bf3293471fed40ffb99</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a97bf3293471fed40ffb99</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Aug 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello大家，因为本周娱乐圈过于平静，所以我们专门做了一期推荐节目，欢迎大家一起讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> small talk说一下目前的《生万物》舆论和剧情走向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a> 因为这周没什么大消息，所以我们决定专门做一期推荐（但还是聊了一下许凯）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> CP部分提到了包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>白客×任何人，陆地夫妇，耽改超级大爆CP，白鹿×敖瑞鹏，刘诗诗×吴奇隆，果郡王×甄嬛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 宝藏剧集包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我有一个朋友、所有情景喜剧、影后、俗女养成记、不够善良的我们、古相思曲、伦敦生活、珠江人家、娘道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 宝藏综艺包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>地球超新鲜、新手驾到、非常帮助、女子推理社</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 宝藏电影包括但不限于：</span></p><span></span><p><span>浪浪山小妖怪、沙丘、银河写手</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐，周五对炮姐的分层肤色非常好奇的东北扛把子</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，花了179通马桶的伤心girl</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64a945ca73e3c34a6745c0bd/lh60kDNzX3AOQIeiu0KiNKoVKdDd.m4a" length="60685470" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-hCg3SzXKbZAc9kUC7t9mdeSK8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>杨幂转型之作《生万物》热度破万，好本子面前，演技不重要了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a09fb8293471fed4f1f3e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a09fb8293471fed4f1f3e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家，今天来说一下《生万物》，大家口下留情！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 炮炮锐锐“病友”见面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 《生万物》数据解析，炮姐认证“断层热播剧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 剧情简单介绍，幂姐和欧豪神神联合，前几集戏剧冲突拉满！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">11:27</a> 幂姐演技有进步，但是自己一个图层，千万别营销演技</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 简单梳理一下幂姐的演戏历程，姐娱乐圈真劳模</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 欧豪起到一个糙汉上的作用，立志于给所有想转型的流量花当二番男主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1742">29:02</a> 邢菲眼前一亮，大脚娘迟蓬（这里口误说成绣绣娘了）yyds，秦海璐无功无过，倪大红模板化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">38:47</a> 推荐环节</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐：红高粱</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，抖音海龟汤真神许二木</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐，奔波于杭州和上海的脆皮</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，眼睛超级脆弱的脆皮</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64a945ca73e3c34a6745c0bd/luljtSzomOYqwBjDw9Z3RzIHPxnm.m4a" length="63344220" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-hCg3SzXKbZAc9kUC7t9mdeSK8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
