  <item>
    <title>赵露思开大银河酷娱，天娱200亿施压陈楚生，为啥经纪公司和艺人总会撕破脸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6896c49620a2906a4da4848c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6896c49620a2906a4da4848c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Aug 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello大家好，这里是炮姐和锐锐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们想从赵露思和银河酷娱谈起，梳理一下经纪公司和艺人解约的“不体面”事件。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你觉得哪位艺人应该迅速离开现在的公司，也欢迎在评论区讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外我们的听友群已经开通，欢迎大家扫描最后的二维码加入~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 赵露思、银河酷娱撕破脸事件全解析：赵露思直接开大，银河酷娱避重就轻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 陈楚生拿下《歌手2025》冠军惹争议，回忆一下和天娱200多亿解约事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 总选落下帷幕，丝芭出走半生，归来只有鞠婧祎破圈，解约拉锯战仍在进行中（不知道怎么回事聊到宗教和精神寄托了哈哈哈）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> 欢瑞“三公章”事件回顾，杨紫参演《沉香如屑》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a> EXO中国艺人解约，算是艺人没有契约精神吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> 为什么经常会发生艺人和经纪公司解约纠纷：利益、公平还是其他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 我们希望感觉摆脱吸血鬼公司的艺人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> 推荐环节：</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐，南京照相馆，刘昊然演技有提升，申奥值得被关注，文牧野还睡得着吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，天才俱乐部再次推荐，不算烂尾，有时间可以看看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 彩蛋环节，一定要听到</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，被锐锐最后的话治愈的内耗小写手</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐，人美心善的女神！！！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo7z7zC1bdASOTlTx5ksuh9mqer0.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64a945ca73e3c34a6745c0bd/lirzP_GD70CJdmfFgTGS0zpBQWFS.m4a" length="65282841" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-hCg3SzXKbZAc9kUC7t9mdeSK8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>杨洋和李乃文搞CP，男主颜值秒杀女主，《凡人修仙传》有点意思</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688d9d64edf3fa32d5b71268</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688d9d64edf3fa32d5b71268</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Aug 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊一聊最近开播的男频IP改编剧《凡人修仙传》啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（下面有我们的听友群二维码哦，欢迎大家加入）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a> 《凡人修仙传》初印象：锐锐杨洋脸在江山在，炮姐锐评“双修”热搜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="287">04:47</a> 原著网文介绍：首发起点，凡人流开创者，作者励志故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 演技大点兵：杨洋竟是年轻演技天花板，赵晴傻，金晨怪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="933">15:33</a> 剧集优劣总结：</span></p><span></span><p><span>好的地方：杨洋的脸、特效、服化道、节奏还可以</span></p><span></span><p><span>不好的地方：女主选角、部分镜头很奇怪、轻喜剧太突兀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 细说过往男频大IP改编结果：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《倚天屠龙记》《三国演义》《大奉打更人》《庆余年》《赘婿》《斗罗大陆》《斗破苍穹》《武动乾坤》等</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近的《万古最强宗》和《师兄太稳健》，顺便锐评了一下敖瑞鹏，向王鹤棣道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 男频改编怎么才能成功：</span></p><span></span><p><span>适应时代；一定要搞群像；特效别虚浮；运气很重要，杨洋给五哈磕一个吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> 推荐环节：</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐推荐综艺《地球超新鲜》，嘉宾破次元壁了，孙红雷、陈星旭、李乃文、刘宇宁等等等</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐安利可能烂尾的科幻小说《天才俱乐部》，有看完的朋友说一下烂尾了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>快来加我们的听友群啦~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5qxokVp-TmK1b7W7sIgpZrOtMl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，一个写稿民工，日常灵感枯竭</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐，AI行业打工人，最近沉迷倚天屠龙记</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64a945ca73e3c34a6745c0bd/lk9KXqovpc_BEB_E2AlCLAEyxDz7.m4a" length="54742553" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:37:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-hCg3SzXKbZAc9kUC7t9mdeSK8.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>从于正和七七谈起，锐姐娱乐圈的人脉竟是他！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6884a1e6a12f9ff06a1fb6be</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6884a1e6a12f9ff06a1fb6be</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Jul 2025 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家，我们的听友群已开通，速来唠嗑，祝大家天天开心，时间线在二维码图片之后哦~</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn."></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a>本期主题：素人成名那些事儿，回顾于正和素人女孩七七的故事，于正放弃接触，七七方否认变现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 费启鸣：锐姐高中学长，从抖音网红到演员，参演《大明下的显微镜》《白夜追凶2》但本人不温不火</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 敖瑞鹏：嘉尚传媒男网红到手握双破万剧，《白月梵星》《朝雪录》水分好像有点大</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 那艺娜：从俄罗斯娜娜到年轻人心头好，封杀之后浴火重生，上杂志接推广，娜姐赢麻了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 刘宇宁：厨子、歌手、演员综合体，虽然经常名列丑男盘点，但哥资源是真好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> 冯提莫&amp;张诗尧：冯提莫破圈失败，最近亮相旭旭宝宝十年水友会；张诗尧青海摇秋招后从良，改走变装路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2238">37:18</a> 网红破圈成明星，如何长红</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2381">39:41</a> 推荐环节</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐：长安的荔枝，幂姐好美</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐：边水往事真的好看，都去支持！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>锐锐，结膜炎受害者，大家注意身体</span></p><span></span><p><span>炮姐，剧荒中，大家给我推推剧吧！</span></p>]]></description>
